  "question": "设 $A$ 是 $m \\times n$ 阶矩阵. 证明 $Ax = b$ 有解的充分必要条件是方程组 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}z = 0$ 的解满足 $b^{\\mathrm{T}}z = 0$ .",
  "answer": "得证",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "向量组秩",
    "解的判定",
    "证明技巧",
    "线性相关/无关"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 必要性显然；充分性，题设条件“ $A^{T}z=0$ 的解满足 $b^{T}z=0$ ”等价于“ $\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}A^{T}z&=0\\\\ b^{T}z&=0\\end{aligned}\\right.$ 与 $A^{T}z=0$ 同解”。再由此去证明 $\\operatorname{rank}(A,b)=\\operatorname{rank}(A)$ 就容易了。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "必要性：若 $Ax = b$ ，则"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "$$\n\\boldsymbol {x} ^ {\\mathrm{T}} \\boldsymbol {A} ^ {\\mathrm{T}} = \\boldsymbol {b} ^ {\\mathrm{T}}, \\quad \\boldsymbol {x} ^ {\\mathrm{T}} \\boldsymbol {A} ^ {\\mathrm{T}} \\boldsymbol {z} = \\boldsymbol {b} ^ {\\mathrm{T}} \\boldsymbol {z}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "若 $A^{T}z=0$ ，则必有 $b^{T}z=0$ 。必要性得证。"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "充分性：若 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}z = 0$ 的解满足 $\\pmb{b}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\pmb {z} = \\mathbf{0}$ ，则 $\\left( \\begin{array}{c}\\pmb {A}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\\\ \\pmb {b}^{\\mathrm{T}} \\end{array} \\right)\\pmb {z} = \\mathbf{0}$ 与 $A^{\\mathrm{T}}z = \\mathbf{0}$ 同解．所以"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "$$\n\\operatorname{rank} (A ^ {\\mathrm{T}}) = \\operatorname{rank} \\binom {A ^ {\\mathrm{T}}} {b ^ {\\mathrm{T}}} \\Rightarrow \\operatorname{rank} (A) = \\operatorname{rank} (A, b) ^ {\\mathrm{T}} = \\operatorname{rank} (A, b).\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s7",
        "text": "所以 Ax=b 有解."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "得证",
